BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50 330 Td (The vector UML 2.0 Component Diagram with ball-and-socket assembly connectors) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50 315 Td (is available in the repository at assets/component_diagram.svg & component_diagram.puml.) Tj ET
